            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slahhángw tám bál tawa wak, kurkú mibaá nee wak, iimír atén tiwa loohatís, axweesantá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ana axaás, i kat, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Heewí, waawutmo Farao oo Misri nee mukós ki beer,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Gawaá adoorihe anuú Aakoó MUNGÚ a kah, ‹Asma kiíng ana tleeruúr, nee tsitsiniirók tiri gáwtár dúx baraá haleemiidá' urene, tlenaangók kuri ar daara/aán. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng a haniís gawaá dabaá geeraharusmoó xoordu. Inós ga sakwasleemuut, ngiri amór saáw i kwaáhh har qoomoó tlakweemaawós. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk xoordu oo ló'wa xaraásl sahhtidá' ngi tsatiyá', nee ngiri yaamií kwahhiyá', nee kari geexáy. Haleemoowós niri yaamií huuhu'uná' gawaá tlom'ií alé nee baraá xatso, nee baraá mapeeraá ma'aay nee yaamu ngiri dalaa/iyá' sleémeero. Muu sleémeero didár mahhtirós ngiri geexayá' nee ngiri mayá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsir/o sleémeero iri iwít gawaá gu/eemidaá haleemi, nee makaá sla/a sleémeero haleemiidá' ngiri adaraahiyá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoorí ina tleehharút asma xaai sleémeero kudaá dír ma'aay mindiwa tlenaanuyé' ay gawaá doori. Xa'anoó hatlá' oo taa eemiís tlenaango adór kwí mingiwa malé áy. Asma umuú gaa alhhe'eesaywós a gwa'ara, tam muu sleeme a adoorí, sleémeero ta /eet baraá gi'i.›",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Gawaá adoorihe anuú Aakoó MUNGÚ a kah, ‹Baalaadá' sahhti iwa hardát baraá gi'i ana uuntsuús ar giwti, yauuwós ina kahaás, nee duxeedá' yaariir wa/amiim ana ilaá/. Tam Lebanoni ana qaás baraá giwti tawa layár gurhaamir'ín, nee xaai sleémeero baraá sla/to niri /araarané' as inós. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xoordu ina daaraxaás ar afór huu'umaawós, qoomár ngiwa yaamií daáhh baraá gi'i, dinkwa nee kudá' /e/etimá' baraá bohoongw, nee xaai sleémeero awa Edeni, xaa'aá hhohho' awa dimbé baraá Lebanoniro, kudá' taa eemiís ar ma'aay, kina gurkwa/amís baraadaá gi'iiwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín sleeme tana /eét baraá gi'i dinkwa nee inós, tam kudá' nee inós taa dabe oohiye', kudá' aa huungu/uumiis baraá mahhtuuwós wa alé.›",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
